### 创建角色
POST {{baseUrl}}/system/role/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "运营",
  "code": "operator",
  "sort": 3,
  "status": 0,
  "remark": "运营角色"
}

### 修改角色
PUT {{baseUrl}}/system/role/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 3,
  "name": "运营",
  "code": "operator",
  "sort": 3,
  "status": 0,
  "remark": "运营角色"
}

### 删除角色
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/system/role/delete?id=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取角色
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/role/get?id=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 分页查询角色
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/role/page?pageNum=1&pageSize=10&name=&status=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取角色精简列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/role/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取角色拥有的菜单编号列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/role/get-menu-id-list?roleId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 分配角色菜单
PUT {{baseUrl}}/system/role/assign-menu
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roleId": 2,
  "menuIds": [1]
}
